observed = "The release revision declares the published version: every Cargo workspace, package.json, pyproject.toml, pom.xml and LayerX.Sdk.csproj carries 0.1.0 and the Cargo path dependencies between the nine published crates carry no version. Run locally, tools/ci/release-version.py printed version=0.1.0, and tools/ci/release-version.py --tag sdk-v0.1.0-beta.1 exited 1 listing 57 manifests that must carry 0.1.0-beta.1 with exact internal pins before a beta tag can publish."
assumption = "Tagging sdk-v<version>-beta.<n> is an owner action on a revision whose manifests already declare that pre-release version with exact internal pins; the pipeline refuses to rewrite manifests at publish time so the published bytes stay byte-comparable to the tagged source. Cargo and npm caret ranges do not match pre-release versions, so the pins are required rather than cosmetic."
severity = "note"

