observed = "Two pre-existing Dockerfile defects surfaced on the first full image builds and were repaired under task 3.7 by extending its touches, because do_1 builds every hosted image from its Dockerfile. First, the rust:alpine build stages of platform/hosted/testnet, gateway and faucet installed only openssl-dev, so the static musl link of every native-tls binary failed with ld: cannot find -lssl / -lcrypto (have you installed the static version of the ssl library?); openssl-libs-static is now installed in those three stages and in the new registry Dockerfile. Second, platform/hosted/dashboard/web/Dockerfile ran npm --prefix /src/human/apps/web run build --workspace @layerx/ui, which npm 11.5.1 refuses with No workspaces found because human/apps/web/package.json declares no workspaces field; the Dockerfile now runs the existing build:ui script (cd packages/layerx-ui && rm -rf dist && ../../node_modules/.bin/tsup), which built the library successfully. The Makefile developer-dashboard-build recipe at Makefile:2640 still uses the --workspace form and is left as written."
