observed = "The beta deployment now has an explicit immediate-beta input profile with zero governance delay, selected prediction and deployment entrypoints, and a separate chain-125-only timelock artifact. The standard constructor and validator still enforce the one-day minimum. Scheduling, proposer/executor authorization, target-selector permission, execution replay protection, grace period, economic input validation, real bond deposits and blueprint finalization remain enforced. The bootstrap command runs the existing deploy, permissions, activate, bond and finalize phases in order without advancing block time. Six executed profile checks accepted the new profile and standard inputs and refused nonzero immediate delay, unknown profile, profile mismatch with an existing standard record and another chain; /tmp/layerx-immediate-beta-profile-tests.log. Shell syntax passed. Contract qualification passed 52 tests with zero failures and zero skipped, including same-block immediate-beta operation, unauthorized and replay rejection, wrong-chain rejection, standard delay enforcement, deployment validation and existing manager/integration suites; /tmp/layerx-immediate-beta-contract-tests.log. The full bootstrap passed on a fresh real Paxeer chain through the TLS boundary: deploy, permissions, activate, bond and finalize all recorded, blueprint seal checked on-chain, 1 boundary unit and 2 real-chain/domain integration tests passed, real-chain suite elapsed 634.88 seconds; /tmp/layerx-immediate-beta-real-chain.log. Strict boundary all-target clippy passed in /tmp/layerx-immediate-beta-boundary-clippy.log; Solidity formatting and shell syntax passed. No existing owner chain or deployed contract was changed by these source edits."
assumption = "This implements the explicitly requested beta deployment timing change. An existing deployed standard timelock keeps its original delay; changing the selected source profile does not alter its runtime or reinterpret its deployment record. This closes the requested timing change; task 6.6 remains in_progress for its remaining image and cluster integration requirements."
severity = "note"

